 ],
 "strings": {
  "But tempting him was easy enough, and soon\nwe were working together to sabotage the Center.": "",
  "Sabotage?": "",
  "Yes. He drove out the ADDC's most promising talent,\nand sold their cutting-edge research to rival labs.": "",
  "Yes. He drove out the ADDC's most promising talent,\nand sold its cutting-edge research to rival labs.": "",
  "He performed his part admirably.": "",
  "He truly did a fine job.": "",
  "Sounds like a real douchebag,\nif you ask me.": "",
  "Fine job of bein' a douchebag.": "",
  "So you're saying you bought off\na government official.": "",
  "So Hashiki was your spy\nin the system?": "",
  "Yes, and it was easy.": "",
  "Yes... that's right.": "",
  "But then, just as the ADDC was on its last legs...\nsomething breathed life back into it.": "",
  "Which was?": "",
  "Minister Kazami did a complete 180.\nHe took Kido's side, and vowed to keep the Center open.": "",
  "From that day forward, Kazami's stance changed completely.\nHe took Kido's side, and vowed to keep the Center open.": "",
  "That drug ruined\nthe whole damn operation.": "",
  "That damn drug ruined\nthe whole damn operation.": "",
  "And where's Hashiki now?": "",
  "Dead.": "",
  "He was beaten to death\nsome six months ago.": "",
  "Six months ago, he was\nbeaten to death in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Somebody murdered the\nvice director of the ADDC?": "",
  "The vice director of the ADDC\nwas murdered...?": "",
  "They're still not sure who was responsible.": "",
  "They never found the one responsible.": "",
  "The cops wrote it off as a drunken brawl,\nand that was the end of it.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nI want you to investigate Hashiki's death.": "",
  "I have reason to believe\nit was premeditated.": "",
  "And what makes you think that?\nYou sound pretty sure.": "",
  "You're sure he was murdered?\nWhat makes you think that?": "",
  "He was suspicious of AD-9.\nThought it was all a hoax.": "",
  "Because... he was convinced\nAD-9 was some kind of hoax.": "",
  "A hoax? But why?": "",
  "Just when we started talking about closing the Center,\nalong came this revolutionary new drug to save the day.": "",
  "Right when we started talking about closing the Center,\nalong came this revolutionary new drug to save the day.": "",
  "The timing was too convenient.": "",
  "The timing was all too convenient.": "",
  "That's what Hashiki thought, at least. He was sure\nthat there was more to AD-9 than met the eye.": "",
  "Hashiki was sure there was\nmore to AD-9 than met the eye.": "",
  "So, he did some digging...\nand not long after, he was murdered.": "",
  "So, he did some digging for answers...\nand turned up dead in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Are you saying Director Kido bumped him off?\nThat's a pretty serious accusation.": "",
  "So, what you're saying is Kido\nbumped the guy off?": "",
  "If that were the case,\nI'd still be able to shutter the Center.": "",
  "The redevelopment project would begin anew,\nand all of my investments would finally turn a profit.": "",
  "The redevelopment project would begin anew,\nand all of my investment would finally see some profit.": "",
  "But as of right now...\nI'm 100 billion in the red!": "",
  "But now, after all this...\nI'm 100 billion in the red!": "",
  "That's a lot of money!": "",
  "Huh!? A hundred billion!?": "",
  "I can't leave that large\nan investment on the table.": "",
  "I can't leave that large an investment\non the table.": "",
  "No wonder you're so hung up.": "",
  "No wonder you've\ngot an axe to grind.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Whoever killed Hashiki probably did it to spite Kajihira.\nMost likely someone working to protect AD-9.)</color>": "",
  "The ADDC is hiding something, I'm sure of it.": "",
  "The ADDC is hiding something,\nI'm sure of it.": "",
  "And that lawyer Shintani was close to figuring out what.\nAt least, until he got his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "And that lawyer Shintani was close to figuring out what.\nUntil he got his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Things are not all they seem\nto be at the ADDC.": "",
  "Things are not all they seem to be\nat the ADDC.": "",
  "And if that's the case, you must want\nto know the truth, too... Yagami-san.": "",
  "And if that's the case,\nyou must want to know the truth, too... Yagami-san.": "",
  "That's why I came to you.": "",
  "That's why I came to you specifically.": "",
  "There's nobody else\nI could ask to do this.": "",
  "For this job...\nI would choose no-one else.": "",
  "Hattori-san.": "",
  "...Hattori-san.": "",
  "Mafuyu almost got kidnapped\nthanks to you.": "",
  "Anything you wanna say?": "",
  "Chairman Kajihira pretty much\nkidnapped me, too.": "",
  "The only reason I'm here is because\nChairman Kajihira kidnapped me, too.": "",
  "Going after your girl wasn't my idea.\nI was just looking out for myself.": "",
  "It's not like I enjoyed being\ninterrogated for dirt on you.": "",
  "Still feels like you owe us an apology.": "",
  "Still feels like you owe us\nan apology.": "",
  "That guy's the fucking worst.": "",
  "Hey, shouldn't we roll outta here?\nOur friend's just about waking up.": "",
  "Hey, shouldn't we roll outta here?\nLook. Nap time's almost over.": "",
  "Good point. Let's go.": "",
  "Good point.\nLet's go.": "",
  "Yeah, the name's Hashiki.\nUsed to be vice director of the ADDC.": "",
  "Yeah, Hashiki was vice director\nof the ADDC.": "",
  "Mmhm. Murdered in Kamurocho six months ago.": "",
  "Yeah.\nMurdered in Kamurocho six months ago.": "",
  "Sorry to spring this on you, Hoshino.\nThink you could get all that for me by tomorrow?": "",
  "Sorry to spring this on you, Hoshino-kun, but could\nyou do some research? I'll check in tomorrow.": "",
  "Okay, thanks.": "",
  "Well, looks like that's it for today.\nSee ya at Genda's tomorrow?": "",
  "There we go. That's a wrap for today.\nSee ya at Genda's tomorrow?": "",
  "Night, boys.": "",
  "What's up, Sugiura?": "",
  "Mm?": "",
  "I was just thinking,\nteaming up with you was the right call.": "",
  "I think... teaming up with you\nwas the right call.": "",
  "Should make some progress on my investigation\nnow that Kajihira himself is out in the open.": "",
  "Now that Kajihira himself is out in the open,\ndigging up the rest of this shouldn't be too hard.": "",
  "I wouldn't have saved Mafuyu without you,\neither. Thanks again.": "",
  "No prob. Lemme know\nif anything else comes up.": "",
  "Sure. Lemme know if\nyou need any more help.": "",
  "(A full night's sleep sounds pretty good\nright about now.)": "",
  "(I've gotta get over to Genda's office.\nI hope Hoshino-kun found some info...)": "",
  "There you are, Tak.": "",
  "Tak, there you are.": "",
  "Kaito-san. You're here early.": "",
  "You're here early, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Early bird nabs the murderer, yeah?\nHoshino-kun dug up some dirt on Hashiki.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun dug up some pretty interesting dirt.\nThere's stuff in there on Hashiki.": "",
  "I heard the Kyorei Clan\nattacked Mafuyu last night.": "",
  "Um... I heard Mafuyu got attacked last night.\nBy the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "You already talked to her...?": "",
  "Ah. You already talked to her?": "",
  "Yeah. She seemed... happy.\nProbably because you came to the rescue.": "",
  "Yeah. But... she seemed a little happy.\nMaybe because you're the one who rescued her.": "",
  "Is Genda-sensei still out of commission?": "",
  "No, he'll be here this afternoon. He didn't sound\nvery energetic when we spoke, though.": "",
  "No, he'll be here this afternoon.\nThough he didn't sound very energetic.": "",
  "Anyway, back to what you asked me last night.": "",
  "Anyway, about your request...": "",
  "I looked into Hashiki's murder.": "",
  "I looked into Hashiki's death,\nand found some details.": "",
  "Hold up, I wanna hear this, too.": "",
  "I wanna hear this, too.": "",
  "Toru Hashiki, former vice director of the ADDC.\n51 years old at the time of his death six months ago.": "",
  "Toru Hashiki, former vice director of the ADDC.\n51 years old at the time of his death, six months ago.": "",
  "Found lying face-down in a Kamurocho\nback alley in the middle of the night.": "",
  "He was found unconscious in a Kamurocho back alley\nin the middle of the night.": "",
  "He was unconscious, horribly beaten.\nHe died in the hospital three weeks later.": "",
  "From what they could tell, he'd been horribly beaten.\nHe died in the hospital three weeks later.": "",
  "It took that long?": "",
  "It took three weeks?": "",
  "Yes. Apparently he was\ncomatose the entire time.": "",
  "Yes. It seems he was comatose\nthe entire time.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Doesn't sound quite as premeditated\nas Kajihira was making it seem.)</color>": "",
  "Were there any witnesses?": "",
  "Not to the crime itself, no.": "",
  "Nobody actually witnessed\nthe crime itself.": "",
  "However, quite a few people saw Hashiki\nin a drunken argument beforehand.": "",
  "However, according to several accounts,\nHashiki had been in a drunken argument...": "",
  "With a man in a black raincoat.": "",
  "A black raincoat...?": "",
  "And, that's all we know\nabout the culprit.": "",
  "Yes. That's all we know\nabout the culprit.": "",
  "As far as I can tell, the police never found him.\nBut who knows how hard they looked, right?": "",
  "As far as I can tell, the police never\ngot anywhere searching for him.": "",
  "And... that's all I could find.\nLittle more than a general overview.": "",
  "And... that about sums up all I could find.\nJust a general overview, really.": "",
  "Thanks, Hoshino-kun.\nThis is great for now.": "",
  "Nah. This is great for now.": "",
  "Kajihira claimed Hashiki's murder\nwas premeditated, yes?": "",
  "According to Kajihira, Hashiki's murder\nwas premeditated?": "",
  "Huh? Yeah, that's right.": "",
  "Hm? Yeah, that's right.": "",
  "But there's no evidence to\nsupport it whatesover.": "",
  "But everything there points to\na random street fight.": "",
  "Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.": "",
  "Yeah. I was thinking the same thing.": "",
  "If the culprit intended to kill Hashiki, wouldn't\nhe have finished the job? Seems kind of sloppy.": "",
  "If the culprit intended to kill Hashiki outright,\nwouldn't he have finished him off on the spot?": "",
  "On the other hand, if it was just an unfortunate run-in,\nthe circumstances would make more sense.": "",
  "I mean, if it were a random drunken brawl,\nhe'd just leave him out cold.": "",
  "I dunno,\nI think it's the other way around.": "",
  "Nah. I think it's the other way around.": "",
  "If you ask me,\nwhoever killed Hashiki was a freakin' pro.": "",
  "This killer was a pro,\nand a damn good one.": "",
  "Yes, do tell.": "",
  "Yeah. What do you mean?": "",
  "Just look at the end result. Hashiki died,\nand whoever's responsible got away with it.": "",
  "Just take a look at the end result.\nHashiki died, and whoever's responsible got away scot-free.": "",
  "Now imagine if the cops found him dead in that alley.\nThat alone'd be cause for investigation.": "",
  "If the cops found him dead in that alley,\nthey'd be all over that investigation.": "",
  "If he's just unconscious, though... It's easier\nto just call it a street brawl and move on.": "",
  "But, if they just find him out cold,\nthey peg it as just another street brawl.": "",
  "I mean, that's just another day\nin Kamurocho, right?": "",
  "They recognize that shit.\nHappens in Kamurocho every day.": "",
  "True enough.": "",
  "I suppose the incident never made the news\nbecause his death didn't come until so much later.": "",
  "The incident never made the news, either.\nMaybe because his death came so much later.": "",
  "Despite how well-known he was in the\nscientific community, that is.": "",
  "Strange, considering his position in\nJapan's scientific community.": "",
  "So the killer beat Hashiki until he sustained\na fatal wound, then backed off?": "",
  "So the killer beat Hashiki until he sustained a fatal wound,\nthen stopped at that specific point?": "",
  "Is such a thing even possible?": "",
  "Is that even possible?": "",
  "It is if you're a pro. Guys that good totally exist,\nit's just rare to see it happen.": "",
  "It is if you're good.\nGets to be second-nature for guys like that.": "",
  "Know what I mean?": "",
  "Y'know?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Not sure I do, actually.)</color>": "",
  "I admit it would make sense.": "",
  "Well... it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>would</font_kind> make sense.": "",
  "But we can't say for sure\nwithout evidence.": "",
  "Still, we can't say for sure\nwithout evidence.": "",
  "...More or less.": "",
  "What kind of evidence do you mean?": "",
  "What kind of evidence?": "",
  "Something like an investigation report.": "",
  "Something like an autopsy...": "",
  "I wanna know the cause of death.": "",
  "I wanna know the\ncause of death.": "",
  "Which I guess means another visit\nto our old friend Ayabe, huh?": "",
  "Which I guess means... another visit\nto our old friend Ayabe, huh?": "",
  "I'm way ahead of you.\nCalled him myself last night, but uh...": "",
  "Yep. Way ahead of you.\nCalled him myself last night, but uh...": "",
  "His hands are tied 'cause of all\nthis Kuroiwa business.": "",
  "His hands are tied 'cause of\nall this Kuroiwa business.": "",
  "Should've known.": "",
  "We got someone else coming in his place, though.\nMeeting at the same place as before. L'Amant.": "",
  "We got someone else coming in his place, though.\nMeeting at L'Amant, like before.": "",
  "You're gonna come, right?": "",
  "Sure, let's do it.": "",
  "Looks like we got some company.": "",
  "Look at that. Seems like\nwe got some company.": "",
  "Hold up.\nThese guys're Matsugane.": "",
  "Weird. I don't think\nthey're too happy with us.": "",
  "What's their deal?\nThey don't look very happy with us.": "",
  "Oh yeah? What gave it away?": "",
  "Yeah?\nWonder why that might be?": "",
  "Maybe they think we're working\nwith the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "If I had to guess...\nThey think we're working with the Kyorei?": "",
  "Either way, doesn't look\nlike they wanna talk it over!": "",
  "Either way, doesn't look like\nthey wanna talk it over!": "",
  "C'mon, Tak.\nLet's get outta here.": "",
  "C'mon.\nLet's get outta here, Tak. ": "",
  "All we gotta do now\nis meet up with Ayabe's boy.": "",
  "Here we are.\nNow to meet up with Ayabe's boy.": "",
  "Any idea what he looks like?": "",
  "Nope.\nBet he'll talk to us first, though.": "",
  "Nope.\nHe'll probably ID us, though.": "",
  "Let's hope so.\nWell, time to start looking.": "",
  "Let's hope so.\nTime to start looking.": "",
  "Um... Excuse me, sir.": "",
  "Are you talking to me?": "",
  "Are you, uh... talking to me?": "",
  "Sit. Seat next to me.\nHurry.": "",
  "Ahem! Hey!": "",
  "Er— Ahem! Hey!": "",
  "Do I know you, or...?": "",
  "This is no time for jokes.": "",
  "I'm... not?": "",
  "Jokes?": "",
  "Can you please?": "",
  "Seriously.": "",
  "Now, are you okay\ndoing this here?": "",
  "Are you okay\ndoing this in public?": "",
  "Or would you rather go somewhere\na little quieter?": "",
  "Or would you rather go\nsomewhere a little quieter?": "",
  "Whoa, can we slow down for a second?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Which was?": "อะไรเหรอ?",
  "Okay, thanks.": "โอเค ขอบคุณครับ",
  "Mm?": "อืม?",
  "Yeah. I was thinking the same thing.": "ใช่ ลุงก็คิดแบบเดียวกันเลย",
  "True enough.": "จริงอย่างที่ว่า",
  "Should've known.": "น่าจะรู้อยู่แล้วเชียว",
  "Sure, let's do it.": "ได้ ลุยกันเลย",
  "Are you talking to me?": "พูดกับฉันเหรอ?",
  "I'm... not?": "ฉัน... ไม่ตลกเหรอ?",
  "Seriously.": "จริงจังนะ"
 }
}
